Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:23.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《毒液2：屠杀开始》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:15.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣埃斯特感化院 加州 1996年）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:39.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（旧金山警局）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:42.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（墨里根）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雷文克劳夫精神病院）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:32.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现今）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:41.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克莱图斯·卡萨迪会被判死刑吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣昆丁监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:20.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（于苦难中努力奋斗）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:36.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加州罗迪欧海滩）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:50.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（号角日报）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:43.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（混蛋）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:52.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（限速30）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:50.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣昆丁监狱死囚牢房）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.90,0:39:27.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（严禁吃人）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.42,0:43:14.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（化装舞会 表演嘉宾小席姆兹）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.18,0:48:19.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克莱爱法兰）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.59,0:50:21.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法兰西丝巴瑞森遭到击毙）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.22,0:50:24.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警方报告 最高机密）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.48,0:50:27.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（转至雷文克劳夫精神病院）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.47,0:55:54.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法兰西丝巴瑞森）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.79,1:06:01.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（婚礼 恩典座堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,熄灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱图斯 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cletus. Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}My angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did the doctor say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.97,0:01:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说突变进化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the mutations are advancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.89,0:01:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的能力太强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}My powers are too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱图斯 我好害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cletus, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.73,0:01:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要来把我抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming to take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:02:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我送去一个有我这种人的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're sending me to a place where there are others like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能失去你 你是我的一线希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't take you from me. You're my one bright light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will always love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰西丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frances!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰西丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frances!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到你的新家 法兰西丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to your new home, Frances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的男友终于罪有应得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old boyfriend's finally getting what he deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他的世界会更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the world will be a safer place without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨里根警探 恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Mulligan, with all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想去见克莱图斯·卡萨迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anything to do with Cletus Kasady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法 他只想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's too bad, because he only wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次你有机会问他话却搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my opinion, you had your chance with Kasady and you blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦 他现在想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So, what does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他想说出找不到的尸体在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he wants to spill the beans about where the missing bodies are buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你这次得套出他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna have to do the right thing for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 把你的臭手拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Take your tiny hands off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:06:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该当人民保母 吃掉坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be out there, protecting the city. Lethally!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个人想要飞就不能逼他在地上爬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man should never consent to crawl when he has the impulse to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个低能失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a bottom-feeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过多少次我在工作的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times have I told you that I want you to hide yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得乖乖躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I am working?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是讲真的 你得尊重我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am serious. It is important. You have to show me respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尊重 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Respect? Respect? - Yes! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡萨迪会向你爆料 对吧 - 对啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kasady gonna give you the scoop, right? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 错了 - 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wrong. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你搞砸了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you blow everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 你又在说安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I see. You're talking about Anne again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会去 - 我不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will do it. - I don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我吃他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me eat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不配得到好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not deserve nice things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 艾迪布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Eddie Brock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常常想到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样 克莱图斯 找我来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Cletus? I mean, why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮一个被关这么久的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do a man who's buried alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点小忙 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}a kindness, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,传达一个信息给我广大的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a message out to all my…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉丝群\N{\fnArial\fs30}fans…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了报答你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in return,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会给你我的人生… - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll give you my life… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你最近工作不是很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the written word hasn't been working out so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样的独家报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piece like this, an exclusive…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你谷底翻身\N{\fnArial\fs30}would put you back on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:07:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}People love…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,连环杀人魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}serial killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所有的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都告诉你 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}laid bare, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多的屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么找上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 一言为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的信息是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your message?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,遥远的大教堂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That distant cathedral…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我目中一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,折翼的天使…\N{\fnArial\fs30}fractured angel…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是另一个我\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other part of me."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,刊登在你的专栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Print that in your column.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 你要谁看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it? Who's gonna read that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一首随性的俳句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some random haiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,刊登出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Print it…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what's mine…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,大混蛋一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛 - 帮你调查啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Your job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.51,0:09:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget me, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得了头痛可能还有肺痨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a headache and probably got tuberculosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 大声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? A little louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他念诗给我听\N{\fnArial\fs30}He read me poetry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这当笑话吗 我笑不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this some kind of joke to you? Because I'm not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这结屎脸应该笑一笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you could do with a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这种事得花点时间 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. These things, they just take a little time. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你挖到什么消息… - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The second he gives you something. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上告诉我 别害我出糗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep me ahead of the curve, Eddie. Don't embarrass me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我只会挖到两球巧克力脆片冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only scoop I'm getting today is double chocolate chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 我的脑会冻僵\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I get brain freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在看啊 - 拿两支奇异笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm looking. - Grab those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是毕加索 - 不是啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I'm Pablo Picasso. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 过来 仔细看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Come here. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, say what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一栋房子 - 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a house. - Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我知道 是一棵树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know this one! It's a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴 坐下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot! Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,宾果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和克莱图斯·卡萨迪的友情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say your friendship with Cletus Kasady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你解开这几十年的谜团吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is what allowed you to solve this decades-old mystery?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是外面世界唯一跟他说过话的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the only person from the outside world he's spoken with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems he likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个连环杀人魔 不会喜欢任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, he's a serial killer. I don't see how he can like anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克挖出警方查不出的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brock was able to uncover what the FBI and police could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为平息众怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bowing to public outrage,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:12:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州州长推翻他的暂缓行刑决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}the governor of California has overturned his moratorium.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新下令对卡萨迪执行死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and reinstated the death penalty for Kasady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克也像是被打了强心针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brock's career's been given a much-needed revival,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再度咸鱼翻身\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting him back on top once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.45,0:12:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场痛苦的折磨终于要结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}A harrowing story finally comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者得以安息 家属也获得宽慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vindication for the victims and closure for the families,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了一个人的努力不懈\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks to the diligence of one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 艾迪布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Eddie Brock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Venom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以同心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this could be us, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,行侠仗义、破解悬案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going out there, solving cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,打击犯罪 让我吃坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting bad guys. Maybe I eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we save the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.89,0:12:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们已经做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we saved the day. It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我可以吃坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I could eat bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,海风吹拂着发丝 光着脚踩上细沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling the wind in my hair and the sand between my toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.07,0:13:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你又没有头发 - 你都没在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have any hair. - You are not listening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.87,0:13:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能继续过这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot live like this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我饿扁了 - 吃掉他们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm starving! - So eat those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 桑尼和雪儿是好麻吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. Sonny and Cher are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真假 太扯了 有够瞎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious? That's ridiculous. That's what…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你出手太重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that was abusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,太超过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那电视贵得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a $2000 TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要学会控制攻击性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to get control of your aggression.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才有史努奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why we have Snookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能只吃鸡和巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot live on chicken and chocolate alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要吃大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.15,0:13:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡也有大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chickens have brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我完全不能苟同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I most passionately disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 看看这两个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look at those poor idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑子超小的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 又不是它们的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, it's not their fault…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.62,0:14:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫你非得吃笨憨慢…安太岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you live on the old phenylethyla. Laphenylethylan…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苯乙胺 - 我是那么说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Phenylethylalanine. - Yeah, I just said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过很多遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you a thousand times,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有大脑和巧克力才会有\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it is only found in brains and chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道啦 给我听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Well, how about this:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住在我的身体就要遵守我的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live in my body, you live by my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会住在你的身体是因为我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live in your body because, unfortunately, I don't have many options.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这样好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how about this, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,FBI还在调查我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI is still investigating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们涉及的那一堆事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all of that stuff that "we were involved with."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是又有一颗脑袋被吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if one more head goes missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会被抓去外星人秘密基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will get hauled off into Area 51.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了我们 所以我得扛起责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will kill us both. So somebody has to be responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,责任…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是庸才的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for the mediocre.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 食物 - 闹够了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Food! - Can you stop doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 食物 - 别再闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Food! - Please just stop doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹啊 我有交稿期限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, stop doing that! I have a deadline! Will you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 艾迪 - 嗨 陈太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, Eddie. - Hey, Mrs. Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,它跟你问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.81,0:15:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巧克力还没到货 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chocolate hasn't arrived yet. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. We have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,会怎样 你不保护我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna happen? You gonna stop protecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乖乖闭嘴 喂饱你的小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been keeping my mouth shut, feeding your little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 陈老太太原来是个老江湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little old Mrs. Chen is a little old blackmailer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不老 我才39岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less of the old. I am 39.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我就是今城武 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I am Barry Manilow. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意吃陈太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am happy to eat Mrs. Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你不能吃陈太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you cannot eat Mrs. Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜只好用B计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's gonna have to be plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要吃鸡喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要吃人脑才能活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need human brains to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓几只鸡就快闪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, pick up some chickens, man. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃够了恶心的土鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done with this grossness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们能做多威的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all the amazing things that we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在白白浪费才华\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are wasting our talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰 小猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他…放了他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him. Leave him be. Leave him be! Leave him be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要咬下你的脑袋 - 不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I shall remove your head. - No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用来当保龄球 - 不行啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will use it for bowling! - No, you will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们喜欢哪一家保龄球馆 - 七星\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is the one that we like, Eddie? - It's Lucky Strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 把他放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - Put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带你去七星保龄球馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky Strike. I will take you to Lucky Strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打出300分的完美比赛 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I will score a 300-point game. - You won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你剩下来的小肥宅身体留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of your pudgy little boy body will be left here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,泡在恶烂的馊水里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}rolling around in dumpster juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.77,0:17:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Put him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不需要我们的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't want our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不知道她需要我们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did not know she needed our help, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不一样好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮打来了 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne is on the phone, Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 安妮 - 嗨 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Anne. - Hey, Eddie. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 对她好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Be nice to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像在喘气 我没打扰你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound out of breath. I'm not catching you at a bad time, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有啊 我只是在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not at all. I'm just.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在瞎晃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just hanging around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我没回你电话 我猜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I haven't returned your calls. I guess…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要一点空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just needed a little space after the whole…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外星人咬掉人头的事以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}alien-biting-a-guy's-head-off thing, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:17:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,昔日的好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事要告诉你 能不能见个面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, so I have some news, and I was wondering if we could meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好耶 - 好啊 那会很…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - Yeah, sure, that would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会很赞 棒呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be fine. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 明晚如何 - 明晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, great. How's tomorrow night? - Tomorrow night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 晚上八点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Great. - 8:00?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.17,0:18:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芝茱餐厅 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- L'Araignée? - Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很期待 - 我也是 拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looking forward to it. - Me too. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 她跟医生分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - It's over with the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来就是个被狠甩的妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the voice of a woman who just got brutally dumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想看起来超帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to look your best?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.65,0:18:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦我 你老是爱念我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me alone. You are always nitpicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.99,0:18:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,尴尬癌上身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样 毛先生好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how's it going? How's Mr. Belvedere?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是用地毯擦屁股 学你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still wiping his ass on the carpet. He learned that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 法律援助的工作如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. How's the legal aid work going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最爱帮助弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how much I love an underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 所以你才忍受我这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's why you put up with me for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.19,0:19:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得 我觉得应该亲自跟你说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I thought it would be better to tell you in person that…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 安妮 那真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne. Wow, that is…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我送你的那枚钻戒大很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so much bigger than the one that I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,超浮夸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gaudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹 对吧 丹医师 - 对 是丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's Dan, right? Dr. Dan. - Yeah, it's Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 安妮 好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit, Anne. Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很好啊 - 我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I'm okay. Yeah. - Well, I am not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说 恭喜 我很为你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could just say, "Congratulations, I'm happy for you."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相关心的两个人可以说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like two people who still care enough about each other to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让对方没有罪恶感\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that the other one doesn't feel like complete shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:19:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们也能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could do that version of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很为你开心 安妮 - 屁啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I am happy for you, Anne. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.91,0:20:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,新郎原本是我们 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was going to be us, Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.66,0:20:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就很希望丹过马路被车撞飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, for one, would not be inconsolable if Dan were to fall into traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑袋、脚和牙齿都被撞掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lose his head and his feet and all of his teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I ask you a question,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以实话实说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you have the ability to tell me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.55,0:20:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说为你订婚觉得超开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, as in being super happy for you because of your engagement?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你刚叫我说谎 这样很矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you just told me to lie, so that's really confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液也在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Venom with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.31,0:20:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我现在心死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. I'm playing dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean, he…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会变 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't change, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 我惊呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? This is just a huge shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮 我爱你 我得花时间消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne, I'm in love with you. This is a lot to process.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你没能力爱任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is you don't love anybody. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,更无法做出承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commitment's just not your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别嫁给丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not marry Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹给我安全感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan makes me feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我觉得像坐云霄飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you made me feel like I was on a roller coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天要下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you have to know when to get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只要不吐就好 - 不要吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, and not yak. - And not yak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗 不要吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know? Not yak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.48,0:21:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液 好好照顾他 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Venom. Take care of him, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他搞砸一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him keep messing everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要逼你哭 艾迪 她会很感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to make you cry now, Eddie. She will love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭啊 哭啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cry. Cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.75,0:21:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得慢慢消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot to process.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.59,0:21:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜了 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:22:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 你又不怕出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You don't believe in consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.69,0:22:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,受了伤你会治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No injuries. You fix them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝醉了你让我清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hangovers. You mend them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.65,0:22:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想受伤都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't even hurt myself if I tried!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.79,0:22:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 很抱歉我治不好你的伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I apologize that I can't mend the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.79,0:22:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,情伤的打击又更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emotional pain, it hits much harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续得更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it lasts longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能像个大人咬牙忍住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just need to pull up your big-boy pants and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得倒容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.31,0:22:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是真的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm a real boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是个变形虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just an amoeba.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.65,0:22:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚失恋所以不跟你计较\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will only take that because we are hurting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心兄弟 我会陪你走出情伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, buddy. I will get you through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么让我早上元气满满吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what always cheers me up in the morning, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,香肠和大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sausages. And brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.51,0:23:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说要 我说要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say either And I say either.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.64,0:23:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说都不是 也不是 也不是 都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say neither Neither, either, either, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们结束这一切吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's call the whole thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.06,0:23:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,土豆泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potahtoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢西红柿 我喜欢西红柿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like tomatoes And I like tomahto.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,土豆 土豆泥 西红柿 西红柿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potatoes, potahtoes Tomatoes, tomahtoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.53,0:23:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们结束这一切吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's call the whole thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心点 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheer up, old pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.45,0:23:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.03,0:23:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们结束这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we call the whole thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we must part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是寄给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟一只蚂蚁当笔友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you pen pals with an ant?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.18,0:23:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的好麻吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dearest pally pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:24:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我诚心诚意邀请你见证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hereby invite you to witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.23,0:24:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的…死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}my demise,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.61,0:24:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我临终的一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}my final moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.48,0:24:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是我活在被称为地球的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on this spinning shit wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.16,0:24:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗烂星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we call Earth."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.08,0:24:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把克莱图斯·卡萨迪害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}for bringing about the end of Cletus Kasady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才应该在我离开时替我开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only right that you hold the door for me on my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.75,0:24:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心跳会停止 就跟我出生时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll stop my heart, just like it stopped at my birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.30,0:24:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是小克莱图斯·卡萨迪没被救活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Cletus Kasady had never been revived?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.93,0:24:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会把外婆推下楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would never have pushed Grandma down a flight of stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.52,0:24:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜外婆 你这个老太婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye, Grandma, you puckered old sphincter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.69,0:24:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不会把吹风机丢进妈妈的浴缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would never have thrown a hair dryer into Mother's bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.03,0:24:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 妈妈 我是个坏男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mama, I'm a bad, bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.28,0:25:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不会被老爸打个半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would never have been beaten to the brink of death by Daddy-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.25,0:25:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被送去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sent to…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.87,0:25:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣埃斯特少年感化院\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Estes Home for Unwanted Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那像地狱的马戏团…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That circus of hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.10,0:25:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一线希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one bright light.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.11,0:25:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.77,0:25:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是伴随着鲜血和痛苦出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all born into this world through blood and pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.95,0:25:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个英雄都有一个起源故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every hero has an origin story.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.16,0:25:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.54,0:25:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱图斯·卡萨迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cletus Kasady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.67,0:25:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲抱亲抱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss, hug, kiss, hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smiley face."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.30,0:25:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nut job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.47,0:26:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应该去的 - 那是个馊主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, I should be there. - No, it's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.85,0:26:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I put him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.51,0:26:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他活该 谁叫他要当个疯狂杀人魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, he put himself there when he decided to be a complete lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.31,0:26:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,登登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.23,0:26:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能挺我会很赞 就这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it would be nice just to have your support, just for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.57,0:26:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕃茄酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketchup?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.65,0:26:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是吃到饱餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is an all-you-can-eat buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁鸟我吃掉几个脑残白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's going to care if I polish off a couple of these idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.12,0:26:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道谁是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be sure who is and who is not guilty, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.49,0:26:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.70,0:26:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但有些人被冤枉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but some people take false confessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.91,0:26:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或被迫认罪 我们看过谋杀犯的形成\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they take pleas. We watched Making a Murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.75,0:26:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧 - 没事 只是在练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah, man, I'm just practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.38,0:26:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个掠食者 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a predator, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.75,0:26:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狮子才不吃色拉 - 你又不是狮子王\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lions do not eat salad! - But you're not a lion, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.34,0:26:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比较像猪狗或蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you more of a vexatious little pig-dog-house-bat thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.43,0:26:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.68,0:26:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很讨厌 - 你才讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You suck. - You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.14,0:26:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - Yeah, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.27,0:26:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有借口 只是恐慌症发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have an explanation for that. I think I'm having a panic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.23,0:26:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里签到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll sign here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.15,0:26:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在牢房两呎外 不准碰囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand two feet away from the bars. No touching the condemned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.03,0:27:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.24,0:27:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,访客来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visitor's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.29,0:27:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的事 不是我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a "me" thing, not a "we" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都是你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is a "you" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.84,0:27:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天算你走运 艾迪布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy day for you, Eddie Brock.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.34,0:27:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向你爆料\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a scoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.93,0:27:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔幻悲惨之旅的终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end of the Magical Misery Tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.93,0:27:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worry for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.39,0:27:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,害死一个人怎么对得起自己的良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you live with the weight of snuffing out a man's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.56,0:27:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是来跟你请教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping maybe you could give me a couple pointers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.45,0:27:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很爱搞笑 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny little guy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.24,0:27:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不着 我的记忆超好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need that. My memory is outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.37,0:27:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.62,0:27:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有因就有果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.29,0:27:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的每一个决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every decision you ever make.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.34,0:28:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们弃谁于不顾 以何种姿态离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do we leave behind, and how do we leave them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.18,0:28:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,空荡荡的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A connubial bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.64,0:28:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚床\N{\fnArial\fs30}empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.06,0:28:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在黑暗中苦等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.06,0:28:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会来临的救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the rescuer who never comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.44,0:28:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙在胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy makes zero sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.23,0:28:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我是同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.49,0:28:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心扭曲 恶劣的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twisted insides, mean daddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.99,0:28:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我回家的感觉 像家人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel like home to me, Eddie. Like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.58,0:28:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我在这世上只想要一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And really, truly, that is all I ever wanted in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.96,0:28:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.46,0:28:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你真的不该杀死你外婆和妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing your grandmother and your mother sure is a funny way of showing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.97,0:28:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说出什么事 趁你还没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you wanna unburden yourself with before…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.31,0:28:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被处死之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}this happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.56,0:28:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想为你许个愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have wishes to bestow upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.57,0:29:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 他人真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.11,0:29:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to wish you…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.24,0:29:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一样心痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}this heartbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.07,0:29:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.20,0:29:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你孤零零地过一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish for you to see out your days alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.95,0:29:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你一直以来这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.83,0:29:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话小心 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.04,0:29:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.87,0:29:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害惨了每个爱过你的人 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a cancer to everyone who ever loved you, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.80,0:29:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺骗信任你的未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deceived your trusting fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.30,0:29:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得你老爸从不再看你一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no wonder Daddy could never look at you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.76,0:29:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害死他老婆 就是你老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}after you killed his wife, your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.85,0:29:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她难产而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}just by being born.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! No, no, don't! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.40,0:29:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准你这么跟我麻吉说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak to my friend again like that! I dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.49,0:29:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.11,0:29:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准碰囚犯 你给我退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}No touching the inmate. Hey, back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.16,0:29:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.25,0:29:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.75,0:30:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尝过人血的味道 那绝对不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have tasted blood before, my friend, and that is not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.80,0:30:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪布洛克有个大秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Brock has a big secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.51,0:30:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 卡萨迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Kasady!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.06,0:30:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那可能是个错误 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That may have been a mistake. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.98,0:30:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是艾迪布洛克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, aren't you Eddie Brock?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.94,0:30:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.86,0:30:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾迪 - 我不想再听你碎碎念\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie! - I don't wanna hear another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.41,0:30:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾迪 - 我不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie. - I don't wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.37,0:30:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.54,0:30:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他最后一次接受采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was his last time on record ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.25,0:30:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没提到死在他手下的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no more words for his victims. You know, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没说出尸体的下落 永远都不会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any clues of outstanding bodies, we've lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.55,0:30:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.88,0:30:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是故意的 - 我也道过歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't mean to? - And I said I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.76,0:30:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是故意的 但你还是做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't mean to, but you did it. You just decided, I don't know:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.14,0:30:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,连想都没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.31,0:30:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会被抓或被杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't even think we might get caught, get killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.64,0:30:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才懒得想 你只想吃鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think about things like that. You think about chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.44,0:31:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只为自己想 想你要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think about you, you think about what you want, and you think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.98,0:31:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我提醒你 我来之前你是失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me remind you of something, Eddie. You were a loser before I came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,连屁都不是 我让你特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were nothing. I made you special!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.15,0:31:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我特别 让我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me special? Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.28,0:31:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来之前我有人生 没有鸡 但有梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you came along, I had a life. I didn't have chickens, but I had dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.70,0:31:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有漂亮的未婚妻和超夯的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had dreams and a fiancée and a really successful TV show!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.91,0:31:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却彻底毁了那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you destroyed all of those things by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.25,0:31:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我东山再起 努力过活 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But you know what? I rebuilt my life and now I just wanna live it. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.84,0:31:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么东山再起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how did you build this new life?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.80,0:31:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.92,0:31:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在墙上找到线索 让你当大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who found the clue on the wall so you could be this big, shiny hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.30,0:31:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁找到线索 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who found the clue? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.85,0:31:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.97,0:31:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我才不想当什么大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. This is not about being a hero for me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.36,0:31:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想平静地生活 你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about wanting to live in peace. Do you understand what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.94,0:31:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't understand what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.36,0:31:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想跟你一起住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is about me wanting to live without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.45,0:31:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你老是跟我吵着要吃坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}whining in my ear all the time about eating bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.75,0:32:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,碎念安妮的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}or nagging me about Anne,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.66,0:32:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,砸烂我的公寓 毁了我的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}or destroying my place or destroying my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.13,0:32:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我选上你有多幸运吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how lucky you are that I chose you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.80,0:32:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大哥 是我收容你耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, I'm the only person that took you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.92,0:32:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友把你赶出狗屁星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your friends kicked you off the planet Ming Mong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.22,0:32:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是废物 你是贱民\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you are a reject! You are a pariah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.55,0:32:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我个屁 你什么也保护不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lethal protection, my ass. You couldn't protect anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.97,0:32:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的东西 连洗马桶都不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are useless. You couldn't get a job down here cleaning toilets!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.81,0:32:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry! I don't know what came over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.85,0:32:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我治好你 我再捶你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let me fix it.So I can break it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.49,0:32:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 拿着你的东西 滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out! Get out. Take your stuff. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.79,0:32:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.63,0:32:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.42,0:32:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it down up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.14,0:32:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.69,0:33:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.65,0:33:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不敢 - 我当然敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wouldn't dare! - Yeah, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.86,0:33:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.99,0:33:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好耶 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.62,0:33:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.12,0:33:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.75,0:33:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.30,0:33:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.35,0:33:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我 再看看你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at me. Look at the size of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Puny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.15,0:33:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的胆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.03,0:33:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜要说拜拜啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.66,0:34:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 我们终于有了共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Finally something we agree on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么东西 太扯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the world? All this crazy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.96,0:34:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.02,0:34:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.90,0:34:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.40,0:34:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.40,0:34:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.53,0:34:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.53,0:34:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好耶 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.45,0:34:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.29,0:34:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.71,0:34:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.21,0:34:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望从没遇见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I never met you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.42,0:34:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sayonara!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.40,0:35:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱图斯·卡萨迪 你受到加州政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cletus Kasady, you have been tried, convicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,审判、定罪并判决处以死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sentenced to death by the state of California.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.45,0:35:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿你的死能还给受害者家属公道\N{\fnArial\fs30}May your passing bring closure to the victims' families.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.74,0:35:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也愿你在来世获得平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may you find peace in the hereafter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.62,0:35:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴乱将至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon come chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.54,0:35:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,至死方休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chaos soon come.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.17,0:35:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those your final words?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.30,0:35:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受这场秀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.92,0:36:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,典狱长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.42,0:36:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶即将降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wicked this way comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.85,0:36:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.14,0:37:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.19,0:38:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.08,0:38:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.29,0:38:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.82,0:38:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,典狱长 有遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any last words, warden?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.74,0:38:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣昆丁监狱 愿你燃烧殆尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Quentin, may you rot and burn in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.97,0:39:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全下地狱 但我仍活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}May your walls fall down And may I live to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成一个更聪明更强大的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I walk out a wiser, stronger man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.81,0:39:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,典狱长 你吃起来像火腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, warden, you tasted just like ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.55,0:39:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩被驱逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are being evicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.81,0:40:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用哀怨眼神看我 本来就行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, don't look at me like that. It was never gonna work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.07,0:40:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.04,0:40:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他冲得太快 进攻锋线拦不住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because of how quickly he moved in, the offensive line cannot pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.38,0:40:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,连环杀手克莱图斯·卡萨迪正在潜逃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaking news. Serial killer Cletus Kasady is on the run…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.63,0:40:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,全州展开追捕行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as a state-wide manhunt is underway…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.72,0:40:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.76,0:40:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昨晚从圣昆丁监狱大胆逃狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…after last night's audacious escape from San Quentin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你没死喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - What, you're not dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.07,0:40:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.07,0:40:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能进去吗 - 可以啊 请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I come in? - Yeah, sure. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.45,0:40:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是刚刚看新闻才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just seeing for myself on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.58,0:41:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 这糟糕透顶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, on a scale of one to ten, it's 11 bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.99,0:41:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.95,0:41:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自圣昆丁的消息比扯铃还扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports coming from San Quentin are, quite frankly, bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.04,0:41:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视很赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.83,0:41:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么逃出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.29,0:41:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么逃出去的 真是个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how did he, indeed? That's the million-dollar question.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.80,0:41:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的特别访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet again, you were his special visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.13,0:41:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他跟你说什么 - 我 什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what did he tell you? - Me? Nothing. Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.01,0:41:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没提到越狱计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about an escape plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.68,0:41:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扮成怪物逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about some kind of elaborate breakout costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.81,0:41:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.85,0:41:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么每次都被卷入这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how come every time you seem to be at the center of these things,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.31,0:41:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,却什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then miraculously you know nothing about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.02,0:41:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.94,0:41:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.61,0:41:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.58,0:41:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自圣昆丁的消息很扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}the reports coming out of San Quentin are bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.66,0:41:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean by "bananas"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.16,0:41:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你采访他那天我问过类似的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when I asked you a similar question the day you interviewed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.34,0:41:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报就是力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Information is currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.42,0:41:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该最清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You of all people should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.13,0:41:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.18,0:42:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他会来找害他被处死的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he'd come to try to find the man that nearly got him executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.43,0:42:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我猜错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.35,0:42:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好低调点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd lay low if I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.39,0:42:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.82,0:42:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 努力想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, think. Think, think, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.03,0:42:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Venom do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.25,0:42:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会先找到你吃掉你的脸 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would find you before you find me, and he would eat your face! Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.21,0:42:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.63,0:42:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们弃谁于不顾 以何种姿态离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do we leave behind, and how do we leave them?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.34,0:42:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 空荡荡的婚床逐渐腐朽 - 婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A connubial bed, empty, left to rot. - Connubial. Is it marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.97,0:42:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在黑暗中苦等不会来临的救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting in the darkness for the rescuer who never comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.35,0:42:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.68,0:42:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 层层地狱… - 山丘的教堂一片死寂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "That circle of hell…" - The cathedral on the hill is fell silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.23,0:42:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.23,0:42:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我是同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.98,0:42:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一线希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…with one bright light."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.32,0:42:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心扭曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twisted insides…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.28,0:42:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bright light.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.90,0:43:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我回家的感觉 像家人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel like home to me, like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.12,0:43:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣埃斯特感化院\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Estes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.05,0:43:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crapola!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.43,0:43:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one bites the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.45,0:43:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些怪咖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all these weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.74,0:43:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kind of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.45,0:43:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,超赞的装扮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.54,0:43:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.08,0:43:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome work!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.50,0:43:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最赞的装扮 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greatest costume ever! Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.29,0:43:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本货吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.75,0:43:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我自己做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I made it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.59,0:44:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 谁 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.84,0:44:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 猛男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.84,0:44:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不是我的菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, no, not my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.39,0:44:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从艾迪的衣橱出柜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am out of the Eddie closet!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.92,0:44:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好炫的车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.00,0:44:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车红 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Racer red, got to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.84,0:44:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来开趴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.68,0:44:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.65,0:44:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop, man! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.73,0:44:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.24,0:45:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是真的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are real. - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.24,0:45:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我的母体毒液 我们将所向无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once I kill that thing that made me, we will be indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.71,0:45:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where to find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.79,0:45:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要先帮我找回失去的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but first I need you to help me find something I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.05,0:45:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.34,0:45:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.15,0:45:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.08,0:45:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.54,0:46:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅喔兄弟 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, bro! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.19,0:46:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.86,0:46:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.78,0:46:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的装扮太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your costume is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.15,0:46:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, one person!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.57,0:46:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.54,0:46:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我丢脸 把我藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept me hidden because he was ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.33,0:46:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在看看我 你们爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look at me now! You love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.79,0:46:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.67,0:46:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.84,0:46:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再虐待外星人 那不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this cruel treatment of aliens. It is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.18,0:47:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该都能在这颗星球和平共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us should be able to live together upon this ball of rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.61,0:47:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由自在地做自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free to be who we be!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.65,0:47:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.03,0:47:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.91,0:47:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.45,0:47:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,致命守护者丢麦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lethal Protector out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.67,0:47:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 这场面很难接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was a hard act to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.97,0:47:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你今晚看到我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you could have seen me tonight…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.22,0:47:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.60,0:48:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.86,0:48:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 墨里根 - 我是艾迪布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mulligan. - It's Eddie Brock here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.82,0:48:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望也许不大 但我可能找到线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this may be a long shot, but I think I may have found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.99,0:48:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 你找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, Eddie. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.49,0:48:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上次去见卡萨迪时他提到婚床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I spoke to Kasady, he was talking to me about connubial beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.62,0:48:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有婚礼 当时我有听没懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and marriage, and it didn't make a whole lot of sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.33,0:48:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我在圣埃斯特找到了线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm here at St. Estes, and I found this…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.12,0:48:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在一棵树前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm standing in front of a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.67,0:48:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面刻了几个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm looking at it. It's got a carving on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.17,0:48:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱爱法兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, "CK loves FB."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.88,0:48:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想他可能正在去找这个法兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking that maybe whoever this FB is might know where he's headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.68,0:48:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能传些档案给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you can, I don't know, pull up some files from St. Estes,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.81,0:49:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出这个法兰是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you can figure out who this FB is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.77,0:49:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是法兰西丝巴瑞森\N{\fnArial\fs30}FB, that's Frances Barrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.94,0:49:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that's quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.11,0:49:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's impossible, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.82,0:49:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她挂了 我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead. I shot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.90,0:49:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能效劳吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.34,0:50:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有网络吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got any of those Internets?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.44,0:50:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.91,0:50:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I get out,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.99,0:50:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要剥掉你的脸皮 戴着去派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna slice your face off and wear it to a party!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.87,0:50:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远出不去 席格菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never getting out of here, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.54,0:50:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也出不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one does.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.80,0:50:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰西丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Frances.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.72,0:51:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你男友耍了一招逃脱术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems your sweetheart has done a Houdini.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.64,0:51:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃出圣昆丁监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}act over there at San Quentin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.31,0:51:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的大新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.27,0:51:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 别太兴奋 他找不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't get excited. He's not gonna find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.98,0:51:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,死贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.03,0:51:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}How flattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.20,0:51:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是我的菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.28,0:51:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder where he could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.45,0:51:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.96,0:51:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,登登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.69,0:51:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.69,0:52:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吓到你 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to freak out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.53,0:52:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要你见见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to meet…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.53,0:52:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.63,0:52:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,超性感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.74,0:52:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.75,0:52:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,66年野马\N{\fnArial\fs30}A '66!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.13,0:52:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的梦想车\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dream car.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.96,0:52:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得啊 看看你的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I remember. Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.29,0:53:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.52,0:54:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山警局 投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is SFPD. Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.26,0:54:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 你会害死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! You'll kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.09,0:54:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她敢再尖叫 我就啃掉她的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does that again, I'll eat her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.02,0:54:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它对声音很敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sensitive to sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.52,0:54:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the vehicle! Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.16,0:54:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说爱情已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said romance was dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.58,0:54:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 酒鬼不准进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! No drunks in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.71,0:55:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.30,0:55:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚 给我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out! You get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.09,0:55:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.22,0:55:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venom?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.14,0:55:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难让他们站起来 陈太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having trouble keeping them standing, Mrs. C.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.10,0:55:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.24,0:55:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.03,0:55:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.87,0:55:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.79,0:55:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.68,0:56:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,发出通缉令 设下警戒线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put out an APB, form a perimeter,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.10,0:56:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁州界\N{\fnArial\fs30}blockade state lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.23,0:56:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把布洛克带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring in Brock.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.44,0:56:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了忙 只会浪费你的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no use to anybody here. I'm just wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.28,0:56:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我怎么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I keep thinking? I keep thinking:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.66,0:56:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪还有什么卡萨迪的事没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What else is Eddie Brock not sharing about Cletus Kasady?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.20,0:56:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要艾迪去看他的死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was it Eddie that Cletus wanted to witness his execution?"
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.21,0:56:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯上你就会发生坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad things happen around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.50,0:56:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的公寓去年死了好几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Multiple dead bodies at your building last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.17,0:56:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在龙虾餐厅的奇怪行径\N{\fnArial\fs30}that bizarre outburst at the lobster restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.88,0:56:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭爆炸时只有你在生命基金会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only you at the Life Foundation when that rocket exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.14,0:56:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在鸳鸯大盗会合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now Clyde's found Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.76,0:56:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神病院的医生挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's a dead psychiatrist at a facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.56,0:56:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew nothing about until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.35,0:56:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都说他们看到怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people are talking about seeing monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.43,0:56:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.02,0:56:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean "monsters"?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.15,0:56:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物 克莱图斯去哪这怪物都跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters, Eddie! Everywhere Cletus goes, so goes this supposed monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.94,0:56:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.36,0:56:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.40,0:56:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.16,0:56:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.08,0:57:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密是什么 他怎么能制造幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the secret? How's he making people see things?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.62,0:57:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.21,0:57:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得打通电话才能回答你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't answer any more of your questions without making my phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.09,0:57:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you your phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.14,0:57:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道秘密会怎样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what secrets want, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.47,0:57:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会被揭露 很难保守秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want out. That's why they're so hard to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.94,0:57:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪要你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie asked you to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.61,0:57:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能帮他吗 我们迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no one else that can help? We'll be late for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.57,0:57:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他惹上麻烦 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in trouble, Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.95,0:57:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦老是找上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, trouble is his thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.37,0:57:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又会有外星人 - 当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are there gonna be aliens again? - No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.12,0:57:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想单独跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to speak to him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.75,0:57:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人受伤你就不能替你的当事人说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your duty of honesty supersedes your duty to the client if somebody gets harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.55,0:57:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,法学院没教你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They teach you that at posh school?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.30,0:58:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 安妮 多谢你赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey. Anne. Hey, Anne, thank you so much for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.60,0:58:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那矮冬瓜真会碎念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that little guy's a charmer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.27,0:58:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹上多大的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do I need to worry about you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.35,0:58:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.56,0:58:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,多糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. How badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.98,0:58:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟透了 都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It couldn't be worse, and it's all on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.23,0:58:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么 你都得说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you did, you just need to tell the cops the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.90,0:58:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说他们在追捕的连环杀人魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No, I can't tell them that they are chasing a serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.95,0:58:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体里头有一个外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's also got an alien inside of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.37,0:58:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且它会展开大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's capable of killing everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.08,0:58:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液 告诉我这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venom. Talk to me, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.92,0:58:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不在 它不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not here. He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.17,0:58:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说谎 还是它真的不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this like an I'm lying "He's not here" or is this a real "He's not here"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.93,0:58:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.10,0:58:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.14,0:58:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣埃斯特起火 - 搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- St. Estes fire. All units. - What the actual fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.23,0:58:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 动动脑筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.19,0:58:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道它不吃东西跑不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. All I know is that he can't go long without eating food, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.61,0:58:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且它只吃鸡和巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's eating chicken and he eats chocolate and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.32,0:58:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它守规则的话就只能吃那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is only if he's still observing the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.12,0:59:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.74,0:59:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我得找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean I need to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.45,0:59:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦 你得找到它 我再跟它和好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you need to find him, please. And then I will fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.66,0:59:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我试试看 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll try. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.71,0:59:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,陈太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.71,0:59:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁啊 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's asking? - It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.88,0:59:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.51,0:59:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她讲话够呛 - 听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's a charmer. - Okay, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.39,0:59:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤了艾迪的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke Eddie's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.47,0:59:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没空解释那是大错特错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time to explain why that's off the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.89,0:59:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where Venom is?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.06,0:59:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想伤它的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna break his heart too?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.52,0:59:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想讨论谁对谁做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna get into who did what to who.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.73,0:59:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪说它可能会来吃巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie said he might be here for the chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.90,0:59:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要跟那外星人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak with the alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.31,0:59:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说不会有外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said there wouldn't be any aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.15,0:59:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会有更多 - 新闻快报\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I meant more aliens. - Breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.28,0:59:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长发出宵禁令\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mayor has issued a curfew…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.49,0:59:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦开大声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the volume up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.53,0:59:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萨迪和巴瑞森应被视为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kasady and Barrison should be treated as.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.66,0:59:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,携带武器和极度危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}armed and extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.24,0:59:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚警方持续追捕行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}An all-out manhunt continues tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.37,0:59:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.54,0:59:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莱图斯身上有个共生体 - 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cletus has a symbiote. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.37,0:59:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么瞒天大谎没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other information you're pathologically lying about?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.92,0:59:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孬种 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pussy. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.75,0:59:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾迪需要毒液 - 她骂我孬种\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie needs Venom. - She just called me a pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.05,1:00:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说它不需要他 没有他活得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he didn't need him, that life was better without him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.22,1:00:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你干嘛这么在乎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I don't understand. What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.97,1:00:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.47,1:00:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快给我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get out here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.60,1:00:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.77,1:00:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的啦 看到没 - 有啦 看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously, do you see that? - Yeah, hon, I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪这混蛋得一个人去打怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie's going to have to fight this battle all by his little bitch self.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.78,1:00:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别幼稚了 去帮你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a big baby. Go help your friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.61,1:00:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我连洗马桶都不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said I couldn't get a job fixing toilets!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.20,1:00:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱图斯会去找他 没有你他会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cletus will come for him. He won't survive without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.54,1:00:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啰 因为我才是大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he won't. Because I am the hero of the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.34,1:00:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你是性感大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're the big sexy hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.97,1:00:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最酷 你最猛 你最威\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the coolest, you're the hottest, and you're the bravest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.26,1:00:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.30,1:00:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就站在这里耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still standing right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.89,1:00:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喜欢你 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one likes you, Dan!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.43,1:00:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超爱你大显身手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love seeing you in action.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.44,1:00:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去救那个大混蛋吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go save that asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.74,1:01:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证我们从此就会自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised we'd be free from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.29,1:01:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走进山丘上的大教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'd walk to the cathedral on the hill.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.67,1:01:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一场婚礼 - 三个客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A wedding. - Three guests.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.63,1:01:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一人带一个客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One for each of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.05,1:01:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,射瞎我眼睛的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cop that took my eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.84,1:01:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Brock.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.26,1:01:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Venom.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.97,1:01:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,血色的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A red wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.36,1:01:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't find him?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.87,1:01:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Lord. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.43,1:02:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 丹 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dan. All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.05,1:02:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不跟他讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking to him!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.76,1:02:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它不想出来 - 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He doesn't want to come out. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.76,1:02:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱图斯要屠城 我们得快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to leave now 'cause Cletus is gonna wipe the city out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.98,1:02:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不道歉我们什么都不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not doing shit until he apologizes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.73,1:02:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只要你道个歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's looking for an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.52,1:02:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不喜欢认错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that amends aren't your thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.36,1:02:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在要我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, as in right now, an apology?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.07,1:02:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他跪求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need him to beg.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.74,1:02:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我要当个大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I will be the bigger of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.78,1:02:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是大人 不过继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will always be the bigger of us. But go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.16,1:02:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它说什么 - 它说它在认真听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is he saying? - He said he's listening very sincerely.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.33,1:02:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听好 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen to this. I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.92,1:02:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够诚恳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the right tone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.50,1:02:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.42,1:02:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.63,1:02:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.46,1:02:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.05,1:02:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.05,1:02:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你干嘛对我大吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you shouting at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.63,1:02:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我遇到你之前是个失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, fine. I was a loser before I met you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.39,1:02:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.10,1:02:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的我不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I am someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.94,1:03:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我变得很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me special.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.44,1:03:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.86,1:03:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再加码道歉 - 加码 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you put a cherry on it? - A cherry on that? Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.86,1:03:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.70,1:03:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真心为我所说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am truly very sorry for everything that I said,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.87,1:03:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没说的一切和做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything that I did not say, everything that I did,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.49,1:03:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我没做的一切向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and probably everything that I did not do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.33,1:03:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.08,1:03:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.25,1:03:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.05,1:03:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.97,1:03:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss her!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.18,1:03:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在要亲我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna kiss me now?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.14,1:03:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.89,1:03:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I'm never doing that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.72,1:03:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 老实说 超好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe never. I don't know. Honestly, it's really fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.43,1:03:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救世界就能自称致命守护者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we save the day, can we call ourselves the Lethal Protector?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.31,1:03:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太老派了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so '80s.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.31,1:03:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 快打包走人 有必要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan. Pack quickly. Don't stay. And if for any reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.90,1:03:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 火与噪音 - 火与噪音是乐团吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire and sound. - "Fire and sound"? Is that a band?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.94,1:03:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会杀死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's what kills them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.82,1:03:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 放心 我会罩她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, man, I've got her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.70,1:03:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.79,1:03:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真是抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.41,1:04:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一对很需要伴侣咨商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two need some serious couples counseling.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.25,1:04:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正开到布洛克住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pulling up to Brock's now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.43,1:04:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.93,1:04:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萨迪 把手举高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kasady, place your hands on your head!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.31,1:04:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一只…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.02,1:04:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,手\N{\fnArial\fs30}hands?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.86,1:04:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.99,1:04:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.20,1:04:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖啸会很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shriek will be so pleased.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.04,1:04:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,香喷喷的布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brockalicious!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.43,1:05:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪闪惹人爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bling-a-ling.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.94,1:05:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该套进哪只手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, whose finger were you meant for?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.49,1:05:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小小鱼儿的闪亮亮诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice shiny lure for a little fishy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.34,1:05:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧 毛先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.31,1:05:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 安妮 我掐昏了你男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Anne. I just incapacitated your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.14,1:05:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he'll be okay,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.85,1:05:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你说出艾迪布洛克在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an answer about where Eddie Brock is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.40,1:05:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure as shit not gonna tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.28,1:05:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可惜我得伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shame to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.70,1:06:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉布洛克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Brock.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.95,1:06:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱图斯要来个交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cletus will make a swap.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.58,1:06:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的头换他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her head for his.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.08,1:06:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会杀死你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill you both.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.54,1:06:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeps have tried that already.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.13,1:06:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Botched it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.10,1:06:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't find him!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.77,1:06:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也在追杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are hunting us too, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.73,1:06:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.95,1:06:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dan. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.83,1:06:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们抓走她 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie, they got her. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.87,1:06:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们抓走安妮 - 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've taken Anne! - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.91,1:06:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去他们的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took her to their wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.29,1:06:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪儿 - 他们的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They took her where? - Their wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.00,1:06:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恩典座堂 快去 - 这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grace Cathedral. Hurry. - We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.59,1:06:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们要去一场婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it looks like we are going to a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.21,1:06:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点心吃吗 - 当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, will there be canapés? - You bet your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.75,1:07:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,遥远的大教堂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That distant cathedral…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.13,1:07:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我目中一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.80,1:07:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,折翼的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fractured angel…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.97,1:07:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是另一个我\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other part of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.27,1:07:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位亲朋好友 - 先送礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dearly beloved… - Gifts first.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.27,1:07:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实传统习俗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, traditionally.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.19,1:07:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.24,1:07:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.32,1:08:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我有你最想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I got for you what you want most.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.91,1:08:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那警察 - 那警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The cop? - The cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.99,1:08:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请继续 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.45,1:08:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位亲朋好友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dearly beloved,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.91,1:08:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是有人反对这场婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}if anyone objects to this marriage,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.63,1:08:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请开口 否则就永远闭…\N{\fnArial\fs30}speak now or forever hold their…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.88,1:08:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.68,1:08:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.85,1:08:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了 吾父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death to you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.56,1:08:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.81,1:08:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.98,1:08:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.23,1:08:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.94,1:08:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪 你干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.69,1:08:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想象的糟糕 它是红色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is much worse than I thought. That is a red one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.53,1:08:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 红色的 - 我们得马上闪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Red one? - We should leave. Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.07,1:08:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管安妮 反正我们不喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie will get over it. We never liked her anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.74,1:08:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So let's go. - Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.45,1:08:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜这对新人 然后就闪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations to the happy couple. We are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.66,1:08:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 哈噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.17,1:08:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right with you. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.38,1:08:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得马上出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to come out right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.17,1:08:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在处境超危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I am feeling super, super vulnerable right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.05,1:09:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布洛克跟你一样 - 很快就不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brock's just like you? - Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.55,1:09:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 给我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.30,1:09:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得立马出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to come out right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.31,1:09:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你吃很多人 大吃特吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will let you eat everybody! You can eat them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.56,1:09:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了长袍男 不能吃他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from him in the robe. You cannot eat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.98,1:09:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打勾勾 - 打勾勾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Promise? - I promise!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.07,1:09:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.04,1:09:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.88,1:09:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.09,1:09:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻触礁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage trouble already?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.09,1:09:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 受死吧 - 好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time to die. - That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.26,1:09:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我们 我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean us. We are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.39,1:10:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.97,1:10:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼是杀不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can't kill a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.86,1:10:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Kill him,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.07,1:10:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但给我乖乖闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}but keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.69,1:10:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的老婆知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our wife knows what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.49,1:10:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just turn it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.36,1:10:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在跟谁说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.70,1:10:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拦住他 - 死警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop him! - My cop!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.00,1:11:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜月期结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honeymoon over?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.75,1:11:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.88,1:11:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,威力提升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.26,1:11:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.32,1:11:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救…克莱图斯·卡萨迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday, mayday, mayday! Cletus Kasady.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.63,1:11:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说以眼还眼是怎样来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they say about an eye for an eye?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.93,1:11:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,火与噪音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire and sound!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.73,1:11:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是没有噪音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except without the sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.61,1:12:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.32,1:12:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cletus!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.47,1:12:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,单挑吧 布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mano a mano, Brock.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.36,1:12:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我在牢里是怎么过的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how I spent my endless days?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.58,1:13:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都在想你只报导单方面的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent them thinking about how you only told one side of the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.76,1:13:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没提到小小克莱图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't write about the part where Cletus was abused.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.73,1:13:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,被父母和外婆虐待\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Mommy, Daddy, and Granny!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.35,1:14:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉全世界他是个吓坏的小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell the world how he was a scared little boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.98,1:14:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人在乎他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that no one cared about.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.56,1:14:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没人来救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one came to save!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.94,1:14:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没扪心自问…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never asked yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.45,1:14:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}why!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.03,1:14:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个蹩脚的记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bad journalism.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.38,1:14:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, happy days.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.05,1:14:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a crazy man,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.60,1:14:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很会记仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am a vengeful one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.32,1:14:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看着她死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to watch her die.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.78,1:15:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.41,1:15:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.13,1:15:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.22,1:15:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 我们恐怕打不赢他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I'm afraid we cannot beat them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.98,1:15:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你太超过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, that's too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.40,1:15:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.53,1:15:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.40,1:15:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远让她闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll shut her up for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.95,1:15:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 住手 你会杀死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Stop! You're hurting her!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.66,1:15:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来啊 - 我起不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up! - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.29,1:15:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看 他们不是共生体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look! They're not symbiotic.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:15:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离她远一点 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from her! - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.05,1:16:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your hands off my wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.51,1:16:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not a match.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.85,1:16:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.31,1:16:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们是天生一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. We are.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.86,1:16:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们合体后就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together we are…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.57,1:16:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,致命守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lethal Protector!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.40,1:17:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,展开大屠杀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let there be carnage!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.71,1:18:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱住你 没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.79,1:18:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 我们其中一个必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, one of us must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.08,1:18:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要火\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.92,1:18:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,或噪音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.69,1:19:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.42,1:19:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mackerel!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.95,1:20:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did not taste good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.43,1:20:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个杀人魔 不管有没有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a killer with or without the monster, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.23,1:20:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我想要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I really wanted?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.56,1:20:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 你要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What was it, Cletus?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.61,1:20:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过 但你没在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, but you weren't listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.07,1:20:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm listening now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.20,1:20:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你的友情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted your friendship.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.99,1:20:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 克莱图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Cletus.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.29,1:20:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,去这家伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.15,1:21:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液 快把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in there, get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.65,1:21:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会来抓你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna come for you both.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.69,1:21:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.78,1:21:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Anne.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.53,1:21:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.66,1:21:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You too, champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.54,1:21:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.96,1:21:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也要保重 - 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You take care too. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.04,1:21:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.04,1:21:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们不需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We totally didn't need him, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.84,1:21:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 他只会碍事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I think he was more of a hindrance than a help.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.02,1:21:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.91,1:22:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是唐吉诃德 他旁边是桑丘潘萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there is Don Quixote, and the guy next to him is Sancho Panza.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.25,1:22:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're two very different people.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.58,1:22:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对世界的看法不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}who have very different takes on the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.17,1:22:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,做事的方法也不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different ways of doing things.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.55,1:22:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候根本就不喜欢对方 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes they didn't like each other a whole lot, but ultimately…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.43,1:22:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们合作无间 带出彼此最好的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}they worked together to bring out the best in each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.35,1:22:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.68,1:22:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must go alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.85,1:22:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is me they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.94,1:22:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.98,1:22:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的桑丘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my dear Sancho,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.74,1:22:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是真理的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}facts are the enemy of truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.32,1:22:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.07,1:22:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.08,1:22:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that we…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.46,1:22:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是毒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}are Ve…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.50,1:22:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fugitives!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.54,1:22:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒 也对啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nom. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.92,1:22:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,亡命之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the run.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.17,1:22:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.35,1:23:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你带我来这里 - 不客气 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you for bringing me here. - You're welcome, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.69,1:23:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.65,1:23:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉不能让你享受…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that we can't do anything about the old.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.07,1:23:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,海风吹拂着发丝 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}wind-in-your-hair situation, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.66,1:23:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥修说过 当你爱一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osho says, when you love someone,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.66,1:23:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得接受他们的全部 包括缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}you accept the whole person, Osho? With all of their defects.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.08,1:23:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 缺陷… - 没人是完美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defects. Nobody is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.13,1:23:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒转一下 你刚刚说你爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go back a minute. You telling me? You just said that you love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.13,1:23:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.30,1:23:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去哪 - 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where will we go? - I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.23,1:23:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要致命守护者的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere that needs a Lethal Protector, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.94,1:23:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是认真的 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You really meant it! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.94,1:23:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要披风\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will need a cape.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.15,1:23:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.32,1:24:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要 我们有你 放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I think you got that covered. We're good.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.88,1:27:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我超爱这部电影 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I love this show. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.39,1:27:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯希姆诺的感受都没被顾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximiliano's feelings are not being validated.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.26,1:27:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就不应该偷藏这么大的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, he never should've kept such an insane secret, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.10,1:27:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有过去 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have a past, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.44,1:27:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷藏了什么秘密吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hiding stuff from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.27,1:27:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,横跨宇宙八百亿光年的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighty billion light years of Hive knowledge across universes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.28,1:27:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在你的小脑袋瓜里爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}would explode your tiny little brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.53,1:27:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that even mean, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.37,1:27:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我给你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me give you a taste, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.79,1:27:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们共生体经历过的一点事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the smallest fraction of the things we symbiotes have experienced.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.71,1:27:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.75,1:27:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了吗 艾迪 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready, Eddie? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.64,1:27:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.56,1:27:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! No, no, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.90,1:28:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.69,1:28:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那只是条毛巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's just a towel.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.61,1:28:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.36,1:28:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么 - 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you do? - It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.32,1:28:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个由在下揭露的惊人事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better believe this shocking revelation brought to light by yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.62,1:28:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,提出更多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}has only raised more questions…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.16,1:28:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 关于彼得帕克的秘密…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - About the secret life of Peter Parker…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.66,1:28:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是蜘蛛人 也就是蜘蛛威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}aka Spider-Man, aka the Spider-Menace.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.54,1:28:27.46,Title,0,0,0,0,,但别担心 《号角日报》会废寝忘食…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But rest assured, dear viewers, we here at the Daily Bugle won't rest…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.55,1:28:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.63,1:28:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭露他编织的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until we've uncovered the truth from his web of lies!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.05,1:28:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是J·乔纳·詹姆森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm J. Jonah Jameson.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.18,1:28:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.10,1:28:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿上帝保佑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and God help us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.69,1:28:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你在我房间干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. What are you doing in my room?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.32,1:28:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
